-07-02T06:17:26.534Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-02T06:17:26.534Z","version":1},{"id":"sv_electron","type":"rectangle","x":1395,"y":470,"width":345,"height":38,"backgroundColor":"#f3d9fa","strokeColor":"#9c36b5","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":0,"createdAt":"2026-07-02T06:17:26.534Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-02T06:17:26.534Z","version":1},{"id":"sv_electron_t","type":"text","x":1410,"y":479,"width":315,"height":20,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","text":"Electron UI — 可视化管理面板 (590行 main.js)","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":2,"createdAt":"2026-07-02T06:17:26.534Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-02T06:17:26.534Z","version":1},{"id":"sv_kernel","type":"rectangle","x":1395,"y":515,"width":345,"height":35,"backgroundColor":"#f3d9fa","strokeColor":"#9c36b5","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":0,"createdAt":"2026-07-02T06:17:26.534Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-02T06:17:26.534Z","version":1},{"id":"sv_kernel_t","type":"text","x":1410,"y":523,"width":315,"height":20,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","text":"Kernel Console (Go, 650行) — 无头模式 CLI","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":2,"createdAt":"2026-07-02T06:17:26.534Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-02T06:17:26.534Z","version":1},{"id":"sv_extra","type":"text","x":75,"y":565,"width":1650,"height":50,"strokeColor":"#868e96","text":"启动流程: 动态端口探测 → ZLM INI 补丁 → 子进程 spawn → 健康检查 (重试8次) → 运行时 JSON\n部署: Windows (PowerShell 脚本) / Linux (Bash 脚本) | 公网 & 局域网双模式 | FRP 内网穿透 | systemd 服务\n打包: electron-builder (Win portable / Linux AppImage) | Go 交叉编译 | 完整构建脚本 + 环境检查","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":2,"createdAt":"2026-07-02T06:17:26.534Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-02T06:17:26.534Z","version":1},{"id":"sv_badge","type":"text","x":75,"y":625,"width":650,"height":18,"strokeColor":"#9c36b5","text":"Node.js (Electron UI) + Go (Gateway + Kernel) + C++ (ZLM) | 无数据库 | 端口: 动态优先→1935/8080/9000","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":2,"createdAt":"2026-07-02T06:17:26.534Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-02T06:17:26.534Z","version":1}]}
